# jemdoc: menu{menu.jemdoc}{ee301.html}, title{EE301}, notime
= Wireless Communications (EE301)
Undergraduate · 3 credits

~~~
{Course information}
- *Code*: EE301 \M *Level*: Undergraduate \M *Semester*: Spring 2026 \M *Credits*: 3
- *When*: Monday 09:00--11:00, Building B1, Room 201
- *Office hours*: Tuesday 14:00--16:00, or by appointment

*What you will learn:* how a wireless link works, from path loss and fading to the capacity of
a multi-user system; and how to formulate and solve a simple resource allocation problem.
~~~

